Package: ubuntu-gts9u-device
Version: 0.2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Ubuntu gts9uwifi port contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: systemd, e2fsprogs, gdisk, parted, util-linux, cloud-guest-utils
Description: Device support for the Samsung Galaxy Tab S9 Ultra Wi-Fi
 Board-specific integration for the SM-X910 (gts9uwifi) running an Ubuntu
 userspace on a mainline kernel: first-boot root filesystem expansion, the
 ANA38407 panel cold-boot recovery, and the initramfs pruning this device's
 8 MiB init_boot partition requires.
 .
 Hardware enablement lives in the kernel and in the firmware overlay installed
 by the TWRP ZIP; this package only carries userspace integration.
